"card-item reveal\">\n      <div class=\"card-img\"><img src=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/certs/cert-4.png?v=2\" alt=\"Data to defense: Mastering Information &amp; Network Security\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"cert-img\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"card-body\">\n        <h3>Data to defense: Mastering Information &amp; Network Security</h3>\n        <div class=\"card-tags\"><span class=\"card-tag\">2026</span></div>\n        <p>Comprehensive training covering the full spectrum of information and network security, from data protection strategies to advanced defense mechanisms.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card-item reveal\">\n      <div class=\"card-img\"><img src=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/certs/cert-5.jpg?v=2\" alt=\"Beyond Automation: The Power of Artificial Intelligence\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"cert-img\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"card-body\">\n        <h3>Beyond Automation: The Power of Artificial Intelligence</h3>\n        <div class=\"card-tags\"><span class=\"card-tag\">2026</span></div>\n        <p>Explored the transformative potential of AI beyond simple automation, covering machine learning, intelligent systems, and real-world AI applications.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card-item reveal\">\n      <div class=\"card-img\"><img src=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/certs/cert-6.png\" alt=\"Generative AI &amp; Augmented Reality: Shaping the Future of Digital Innovation\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"cert-img\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"card-body\">\n        <h3>Generative AI &amp; Augmented Reality: Shaping the Future of Digital Innovation</h3>\n        <div class=\"card-tags\"><span class=\"card-tag\">2026</span></div>\n        <p>Explored how generative AI and augmented reality are shaping the future of digital innovation, covering emerging AI tools, immersive AR experiences, and their real-world applications.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card-item reveal\">\n      <div class=\"card-img\"><img src=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/certs/cert-7.png\" alt=\"IT Infrastructure and Cloud Computing: Building the Digital Future\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"cert-img\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"card-body\">\n        <h3>IT Infrastructure and Cloud Computing: Building the Digital Future</h3>\n        <div class=\"card-tags\"><span class=\"card-tag\">2026</span></div>\n        <p>Covered the foundations of IT infrastructure and cloud computing, including system architecture, cloud services and deployment, and building reliable digital solutions.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card-item reveal\">\n      <div class=\"card-img\"><img src=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/certs/cert-8.jpg\" alt=\"Smart Business with AI and Data Analytics\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"cert-img\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"card-body\">\n        <h3>Smart Business with AI and Data Analytics</h3>\n        <div class=\"card-tags\"><span class=\"card-tag\">2026</span></div>\n        <p>Learned how AI and data analytics drive smarter business decisions, covering data-driven strategies, analytics tools, and practical applications of AI in business.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card-item reveal\">\n      <div class=\"card-img\"><img src=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/certs/cert-9.jpg\" alt=\"Python in Action Using PyCharm: Learn, Code, Build!\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"cert-img\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"card-body\">\n        <h3>Python in Action Using PyCharm: Learn, Code, Build!</h3>\n        <div class=\"card-tags\"><span class=\"card-tag\">2026</span></div>\n        <p>Hands-on training in Python programming using PyCharm, covering coding fundamentals, building and running projects, and practical development workflows.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card-item reveal\">\n      <div class=\"card-img\"><picture><source srcset=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/certs/cert-10.webp\" type=\"image/webp\"><img src=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/certs/cert-10.png\" alt=\"Networking Basics\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"cert-img\" /></picture></div>\n      <div class=\"card-body\">\n        <h3>Networking Basics</h3>\n        <div class=\"card-tags\"><span class=\"card-tag\">Cisco NetAcad</span><span class=\"card-tag\">2023</span></div>\n        <p>Completed Cisco Networking Academy\'s foundational networking course, covering network types, IP addressing, DNS and DHCP, and basic network configuration.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card-item reveal\">\n      <div class=\"card-img\"><picture><source srcset=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/certs/cert-11.webp\" type=\"image/webp\"><img src=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/certs/cert-11.png\" alt=\"Computer Hardware Basics\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"cert-img\" /></picture></div>\n      <div class=\"card-body\">\n        <h3>Computer Hardware Basics</h3>\n        <div class=\"card-tags\"><span class=\"card-tag\">Cisco NetAcad</span><span class=\"card-tag\">2024</span></div>\n        <p>Learned the components of computer systems, hardware assembly, peripherals, and how to troubleshoot common hardware issues.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card-item reveal\">\n      <div class=\"card-img\"><picture><source srcset=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/certs/cert-12.webp\" type=\"image/webp\"><img src=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/certs/cert-12.png\" alt=\"Introduction to Cybersecurity\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"cert-img\" /></picture></div>\n      <div class=\"card-body\">\n        <h3>Introduction to Cybersecurity</h3>\n        <div class=\"card-tags\"><span class=\"card-tag\">Cisco NetAcad</span><span class=\"card-tag\">2024</span></div>\n        <p>Completed an introduction to the cybersecurity field, covering common cyber threats, attacks and vulnerabilities, and how organizations defend against them.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card-item reveal\">\n      <div class=\"card-img\"><picture><source srcset=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/certs/cert-13.webp\" type=\"image/webp\"><img src=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/certs/cert-13.png\" alt=\"Python Essentials 1\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"cert-img\" /></picture></div>\n      <div class=\"card-body\">\n        <h3>Python Essentials 1</h3>\n        <div class=\"card-tags\"><span class=\"card-tag\">Cisco NetAcad</span><span class=\"card-tag\">2025</span></div>\n        <p>Completed the Cisco and OpenEDG Python Institute course covering Python fundamentals, data types, control structures, and basic programming.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card-item reveal\">\n      <div class=\"card-img\"><picture><source srcset=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/certs/cert-14.webp\" type=\"image/webp\"><img src=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/certs/cert-14.png\" alt=\"Ethical Hacker\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"cert-img\" /></picture></div>\n      <div class=\"card-body\">\n        <h3>Ethical Hacker</h3>\n        <div class=\"card-tags\"><span class=\"card-tag\">Cisco NetAcad</span><span class=\"card-tag\">2025</span></div>\n        <p>Completed hands-on training in ethical hacking, covering vulnerability assessment, penetration testing tools and techniques, and defensive security practices.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card-item reveal\">\n      <div class=\"card-img\"><picture><source srcset=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/certs/cert-15.webp\" type=\"image/webp\"><img src=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/certs/cert-15.png\" alt=\"Endpoint Security\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"cert-img\" /></picture></div>\n      <div class=\"card-body\">\n        <h3>Endpoint Security</h3>\n        <div class=\"card-tags\"><span class=\"card-tag\">Cisco NetAcad</span><span class=\"card-tag\">2025</span></div>\n        <p>Completed training in endpoint security, covering device protection, anti-malware strategies, and securing systems against modern threats.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card-item reveal\">\n      <div class=\"card-img\"><picture><source srcset=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/certs/cert-16.webp\" type=\"image/webp\"><img src=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/certs/cert-16.png\" alt=\"Network Defense\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"cert-img\" /></picture></div>\n      <div class=\"card-body\">\n        <h3>Network Defense</h3>\n        <div class=\"card-tags\"><span class=\"card-tag\">Cisco NetAcad</span><span class=\"card-tag\">2025</span></div>\n        <p>Completed training in network defense, covering firewalls, intrusion detection, access control lists, and network monitoring best practices.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card-item reveal\">\n      <div class=\"card-img\"><picture><source srcset=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/certs/cert-17.webp\" type=\"image/webp\"><img src=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/certs/cert-17.png\" alt=\"Cyber Threat Management\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"cert-img\" /></picture></div>\n      <div class=\"card-body\">\n        <h3>Cyber Threat Management</h3>\n        <div class=\"card-tags\"><span class=\"card-tag\">Cisco NetAcad</span><span class=\"card-tag\">2025</span></div>\n        <p>Completed training in cyber threat management, covering threat intelligence, incident response, and risk management frameworks.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card-item reveal\">\n      <div class=\"card-img\"><picture><source srcset=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/certs/cert-18.webp\" type=\"image/webp\"><img src=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/certs/cert-18.png\" alt=\"Digital Safety and Security Awareness\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"cert-img\" /></picture></div>\n      <div class=\"card-body\">\n        <h3>Digital Safety and Security Awareness</h3>\n        <div class=\"card-tags\"><span class=\"card-tag\">Cisco NetAcad</span><span class=\"card-tag\">2025</span></div>\n        <p>Completed the Cisco and OpenEDG course on digital safety, covering online privacy, recognizing threats and social engineering, and digital well-being.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card-item reveal\">\n      <div class=\"card-img\"><picture><source srcset=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/certs/cert-19.webp\" type=\"image/webp\"><img src=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/certs/cert-19.png\" alt=\"Introduction to Data Science\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"cert-img\" /></picture></div>\n      <div class=\"card-body\">\n        <h3>Introduction to Data Science</h3>\n        <div class=\"card-tags\"><span class=\"card-tag\">Cisco NetAcad</span><span class=\"card-tag\">2025</span></div>\n        <p>Completed an introduction to data science, covering the data science process, data analysis concepts, and real-world applications.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card-item reveal\">\n      <div class=\"card-img\"><picture><source srcset=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/certs/cert-20.webp\" type=\"image/webp\"><img src=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/certs/cert-20.png\" alt=\"Security and Connectivity Support\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"cert-img\" /></picture></div>\n      <div class=\"card-body\">\n        <h3>Security and Connectivity Support</h3>\n        <div class=\"card-tags\"><span class=\"card-tag\">Cisco NetAcad</span><span class=\"card-tag\">2025</span></div>\n        <p>Completed training in security and connectivity support, covering network troubleshooting, IP addressing, command-line diagnostics, and responding to common threats.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->','My Certifications','','publish','closed