ing responsive web pages.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"cert-card\">\n      <img src=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/certs/cert-2.png\" alt=\"Technical Training Workshop\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      <div class=\"cert-body\">\n        <h3>Technical Training Workshop</h3>\n        <div class=\"date\">2024</div>\n        <p>Completed an intensive technical training workshop covering database management, system analysis, and software development best practices.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"cert-card\">\n      <img src=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/certs/cert-3.png\" alt=\"IT Skills Enhancement Program\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      <div class=\"cert-body\">\n        <h3>IT Skills Enhancement Program</h3>\n        <div class=\"date\">2025</div>\n        <p>Participated in an IT skills enhancement program focused on advanced programming concepts, networking fundamentals, and emerging technologies in the industry.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"cert-card\">\n      <img src=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/certs/cert-4.png\" alt=\"Industry Immersion Program\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      <div class=\"cert-body\">\n        <h3>Industry Immersion Program</h3>\n        <div class=\"date\">2025</div>\n        <p>Took part in an industry immersion program that provided practical exposure to real-world IT environments, project management, and professional workplace practices.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div><!-- /wp:html -->','My Certifications','','inherit','closed','closed','','44-revision-v1','','','2026-07-30 02:15:58','2026-07-30 02:15:58','',44,'http://localhost/wordpress/?p=46',0,'revision','',0),(45,1,'2026-07-30 02:15:07','2026-07-30 02:15:07','<!-- wp:html --><style>\n.cert-page{max-width:1000px;margin:0 auto;padding:80px 20px}\n.section-title{font-size:1.8rem;text-align:center;margin-bottom:2rem;position:relative;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a}\n.section-tit