ass=\"hero-section\">\n  <div class=\"tagline reveal reveal-delay-1\">Portfolio</div>\n  <h1 class=\"reveal reveal-delay-2\">Hi, I\'m <span>Jazzfer Inigo</span></h1>\n  <p class=\"subtitle reveal reveal-delay-3\">4th Year I.T Student &amp; Web Developer</p>\n  <p class=\"desc reveal reveal-delay-3\">Passionate about crafting modern web experiences. Currently studying Information Technology and turning ideas into reality through clean, efficient code.</p>\n  <div class=\"hero-buttons reveal reveal-delay-4\">\n    <a href=\"/portfolio/\" class=\"btn-gradient primary\">View My Work ↓</a>\n    <a href=\"/contact/\" class=\"btn-gradient secondary\">Let\'s Talk →</a>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"hero-social reveal reveal-delay-4\">\n    <a href=\"https://github.com/Jazzfer-2003\" title=\"GitHub\">GH</a>\n    <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/jazzfer-inigo-ab4ab9413/\" title=\"LinkedIn\">LI</a>\n    <a href=\"https://web.facebook.com/jazzfer.quijano.inigo.2024\" title=\"Facebook\">FB</a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->','Home','','inherit','closed','closed','','10-revision-v1','','','2026-07-31 14:33:26','2026-07-31 14:33:26','',10,'http://localhost/wordpress/?p=88',0,'revision','',0),(89,1,'2026-07-31 14:34:48','2026-07-31 14:34:48','','ji-icon','','inherit','open','closed','','ji-icon','','','2026-07-31 14:34:48','2026-07-31 14:34:48','',0,'http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/ji-icon.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(90,1,'2026-07-31 14:35:19','2026-07-31 14:35:19','<!-- wp:html -->\n<div class=\"page-section\">\n  <h2 class=\"reveal\">Privacy Policy</h2>\n  <p class=\"section-sub reveal\">Last updated: September 12, 2026</p>\n\n  <div class=\"policy-block\">\n    <h3>1. Overview</h3>\n    <p>This Privacy Policy explains how this personal portfolio website (the \"Website\"), operated by Jazzfer Inigo (\"I\", \"me\"), collects, uses, and protects information when you visit. By using the Website, you agree to the practices described below.</p>\n\n    <h3>2. Information Collected</h3>\n    <p><strong>Information you provide.</strong> If you use the contact form, the name, email address, and message you submit are collected solely to respond to your inquiry.</p>\n    <p><strong>Information collected automatically.</strong> Like most websites, the Website uses Google Analytics to collect standard, anonymous usage data — such as pages visited, approximate location (country or city level), browser type, device, and visit duration. This data cannot be used to identify you personally.</p>\n\n    <h3>3. How Information Is Used</h3>\n    <p>Information is used only to:</p>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Respond to messages submitted through the contact form;</li>\n      <li>Understand aggregate visitor traffic and improve the Website\'s content and performance;</li>\n      <li>Maintain the security and operation of the Website.</li>\n    </ul>\n    <p>No information is sold, rented, or shared with third parties for marketing purposes.</p>\n\n    <h3>4. Cookies and Local Storage</h3>\n    <p>The Website stores one small value in your browser\'s local storage — <code>pf-theme</code> — to remember whether you prefer light or dark mode. This preference stays on your device and is never transmitted to me or anyone else.</p>\n    <p>Google Analytics may set its own cookies to measure usage over time. You can disable cookies in your browser settings without affecting the core functionality of the Website.</p>\n\n    <h3>5. Google Analytics</h3>\n    <p>The Website uses Google Analytics, a web analytics service provided by Google, LLC. Google handles the collected data in accordance with its own privacy policy, available at <a href=\"https://policies.google.com/privacy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">policies.google.com/privacy</a>. You may opt out of Google Analytics using the <a href=\"https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">official browser add-on</a>.</p>\n\n    <h3>6. Third-Party Services</h3>\n    <p>The Website relies on a small number of trusted providers: a hosting provider (iFastNet / InfinityFree) that serves the Website and processes standard server logs, and Gmail, which delivers contact form messages to my inbox. The Website also links to external profiles — GitHub, LinkedIn, and Facebook — which are governed by their respective privacy policies.</p>\n\n    <h3>7. Data Retention and Security</h3>\n    <p>Contact form messages are retained only for as long as needed to handle your inquiry. Reasonable technical measures are in place to protect the Website; however, no method of transmission over the Internet is completely secure, and absolute protection cannot be guaranteed.</p>\n\n    <h3>8. Your Rights</h3>\n    <p>You may request access to, correction of, or deletion of any personal information you have submitted through the Website by emailing me. You may also block analytics cookies or use private browsing at any time.</p>\n\n    <h3>9. Changes to This Policy</h3>\n    <p>This Privacy Policy may be updated occasionally to reflect changes in the Website or applicable requirements. The \"Last updated\" date above indicates the current version.</p>\n\n    <h3>10. Contact</h3>\n    <p>Questions about this Privacy Policy can be sent to <a href=\"mailto:jazzferinigo@gmail.com\">jazzferinigo@gmail.com</a>.</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->','Privacy Policy','','publish','closed','closed','','privacy-policy-2','','','2026-07-31 14:35:19','2026-07-31 14:35:19','',0,'http://localhost/wordpress/index.php/privacy-policy-2/',0,'page','',0),(91,1,'2026-07-31 15:01:27','2026-07-31 15:01:27','','project-pic','','inherit','open','closed','','project-pic','','','2026-07-31 15:01:27','2026-07-31 15:01:27','',0,'http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/project-pic.jpeg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(92,1,'2026-07-31 15:01:42','2026-07-31 15:01:42','\n<div class=\"hero-section\"><img class=\"pf-avatar\" src=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/project-pic.jpeg\" alt=\"Jazzfer Inigo\">\n  <div class=\"tagline reveal reveal-delay-1\">Portfolio</div>\n  <h1 class=\"reveal reveal-delay-2\">Hi, I&#8217;m <span>Jazzfer Inigo</span></h1>\n  <p class=\"subtitle reveal reveal-delay-3\">4th Year I.T Student &amp; Web Developer</p>\n  <p class=\"desc reveal reveal-delay-3\">Passionate about crafting modern web experiences. Currently studying Information Technology and turning ideas into reality through clean, efficient code.</p>\n  <div class=\"hero-buttons reveal reveal-delay-4\">\n    <a href=\"/portfolio/\" class=\"btn-gradient primary\">View My Work ↓</a>\n    <a href=\"/contact/\" class=\"btn-gradient secondary\">Let&#8217;s Talk →</a>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"hero-social reveal reveal-delay-4\">\n    <a href=\"https://github.com/Jazzfer-2003\" title=\"GitHub\">GH</a>\n    <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/jazzfer-inigo-ab4ab9413/\" title=\"LinkedIn\">LI</a>\n    <a href=\"https://web.facebook.com/jazzfer.quijano.inigo.2024\" title=\"Facebook\">FB</a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n','Home','','inherit','closed','closed','','10-revision-v1','','','2026-07-31 15:01:42','2026-07-31 15:01:42','',10,'http://localhost/wordpress/?p=92',0,'revision','',0),(100,1,'2026-09-09 16:08:17','2026-09-09 16:08:17','<!-- wp:html -->\n<div class=\"page-section\">\n  <div class=\"tagline reveal reveal-delay-1\">Capstone Project</div>\n  <h2 class=\"reveal reveal-delay-2\">Palale Enrollment System — Capstone Project</h2>\n  <p class=\"section-sub reveal reveal-delay-3\">A complete web-based enrollment system handling student registration, subject management, and enrollment records with a secure admin dashboard — deployed live on Render.</p>\n  <div class=\"cs-hero reveal\"><picture><source srcset=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/enrollment-system.webp\" type=\"image/webp\"><img src=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/enrollment-system.png\" alt=\"Palale Enrollment System — Capstone Project screenshot\"></picture></div>\n  <div class=\"cs-meta reveal\"><span class=\"card-tag\">PHP</span><span class=\"card-tag\">MySQL</span><span class=\"card-tag\">HTML</span><span class=\"card-tag\">CSS</span></div>\n  <div class=\"cs-section reveal\"><h2>The Problem</h2><p>Developed as my capstone project, this system replaces paper-based enrollment workflows that are slow, error-prone, and hard to audit. The goal was to replace that workflow with a system where student data stays organized, enrollment status is clear at a glance, and administrators can manage everything from one place.</p></div>\n  <div class=\"cs-section reveal\"><h2>What I Built</h2><ul><li><strong>Student registration</strong> with input validation so records stay clean from the start.</li>\n        <li><strong>Subject management</strong> — add, edit, and organize subjects per school term.</li>\n        <li><strong>Enrollment records</strong> that track each student\'s status through the process.</li>\n        <li><strong>Secure admin dashboard</strong> separating administrative tools from student-facing pages.</li></ul></div>\n  <div class=\"cs-section reveal\"><h2>What I Learned</h2><p>The biggest challenge was modeling the enrollment workflow so records could never end up in a half-finished state. I solved it by designing the database schema around clear statuses and building the admin dashboard around those states. Deploying on Render also taught me a lot about configuring PHP applications and MySQL services in the cloud.</p></div>\n  <div class=\"cs-links reveal\"><a class=\"btn-gradient primary\" href=\"https://palale-enrollment-system.onrender.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Live Site →</a><a class=\"btn-gradient outline\" href=\"http://localhost/wordpress/portfolio/\">Back to Portfolio</a></div>\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->','Palale Enrollment System — Capstone Project','','publish','closed','closed','','palale-enrollment-system','','','2026-09-09 16:08:17','2026-09-09 16:08:17','',12,'https://jazzfer.great-site.net/?page_id=100',0,'page','',0),(101,1,'2026-09-09 16:08:17','2026-09-09 16:08:17','<!-- wp:html -->\n<div class=\"page-section\">\n  <div class=\"tagline reveal reveal-delay-1\">Personal Project</div>\n  <h2 class=\"reveal reveal-delay-2\">Quizard — Personal Project</h2>\n  <p class=\"section-sub reveal reveal-delay-3\">An interactive quiz platform with dynamic question generation, score tracking, and a fully responsive interface — deployed on GitHub Pages.</p>\n  <div class=\"cs-hero reveal\"><picture><source srcset=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/quizard.webp\" type=\"image/webp\"><img src=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/quizard.png\" alt=\"Quizard — Personal Project screenshot\"></picture></div>\n  <div class=\"cs-meta reveal\"><span class=\"card-tag\">JavaScript</span><span class=\"card-tag\">HTML5</span><span class=\"card-tag\">CSS3</span><span class=\"card-tag\">GitHub Pages</span></div>\n  <div class=\"cs-section reveal\"><h2>The Problem</h2><p>Studying is easier with instant feedback, but most quiz tools are heavy or full of distractions. Quizard was built as a lightweight, focused quiz app: open it, answer questions, see your score immediately — nothing else gets in the way.</p></div>\n  <div class=\"cs-section reveal\"><h2>What I Built</h2><ul><li><strong>Dynamic question generation</strong> so every session feels fresh instead of repeating a fixed list.</li>\n        <li><strong>Instant score tracking</strong> with clear right/wrong feedback after each round.</li>\n        <li><strong>Fully responsive interface</strong> that works comfortably on phones, tablets, and desktops.</li>\n        <li><strong>Zero-backend hosting</strong> on GitHub Pages — fast, free, and always available.</li></ul></div>\n  <div class=\"cs-section reveal\"><h2>What I Learned</h2><p>Building the quiz logic in vanilla JavaScript — without a framework — was a deliberate choice. It forced clean state management for questions, answers, and scoring, and made the app fast enough to feel instant on slow connections. Shipping it through GitHub Pages rounded out the deployment workflow.</p></div>\n  <div class=\"cs-links reveal\"><a class=\"btn-gradient primary\" href=\"https://quizard-app.github.io/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Live Site →</a><a class=\"btn-gradient outline\" href=\"http://localhost/wordpress/portfolio/\">Back to Portfolio</a></div>\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->','Quizard — Personal Project','','publish','closed','closed','','quizard','','','2026-09-09 16:08:17','2026-09-09 16:08:17','',12,'https://jazzfer.great-site.net/?page_id=101',0,'page','',0);
